{"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.014868419498942353,"c":1,"w":0.11530971527099609,"t":"Introduction","x":0.80860028627106617,"y":0.062333232094842761},{"h":0.018988596957760562,"c":1,"x":0.086320936739200396,"t":"HOW SHOULD YOU INTERPRET YOUR SCORES?","w":0.64218480428059888,"y":0.10461731371239091},{"h":0.018512794350847628,"y":0.14285717908647522,"c":1,"w":0.8046797688802082,"x":0.084288352152042403,"t":"At the end of each Listening and Reading Answer Key you will find a chart which will help"},{"h":0.021087257825584071,"y":0.16006652384871034,"w":0.79445556640625004,"c":1,"t":"you assess whether, on the basis of your Practice Test results, you are ready to take the","x":0.08425503846225979},{"h":0.015460359755337549,"x":0.081975434357981006,"y":0.1782850917144907,"t":"IELTS test.","w":0.10785424550374349,"c":1},{"w":0.77387074788411458,"c":1,"y":0.19600221334240153,"h":0.020145460068126453,"t":"In interpreting your score, there are a number of points you should bear in mind. Your","x":0.10277345546744167},{"x":0.084276863881193362,"w":0.81498326619466144,"t":"performance in the real IELTS test will be reported in two ways: there will be a Band Score","c":1,"h":0.018759560107623141,"y":0.21387377102755212},{"w":0.76972976684570305,"x":0.082206005114710948,"t":"from 1 to 9 for each of the components and an Overall Band Score from 1 to 9, which","y":0.23195755834140031,"h":0.02114153863122803,"c":1},{"t":"is the average of your scores in the four components. However, institutions considering","x":0.082118466570164611,"w":0.78432688395182293,"h":0.021851387967490532,"y":0.24834954523604391,"c":1},{"w":0.77376983642578134,"x":0.082253980389743048,"t":"your application are advised to look at both the Overall Band Score and the Bands for","y":0.26726714706323262,"h":0.017656275745836725,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.020714725004629786,"t":"each component in order to determine whether you have the language skills needed for a","y":0.28440770907949031,"w":0.80687240600585941,"x":0.082172643963511025},{"x":0.08214816470655488,"w":0.81929295857747386,"t":"particular course of study. For example, if your course involves a lot of reading and writing,","h":0.022974984805912424,"c":1,"y":0.30121798018184598},{"y":0.32073482027680345,"c":1,"t":"but no lectures, listening skills might be less important and a score of 5 in Listening might be","x":0.080178252995274021,"w":0.83347188313802067,"h":0.01960961529447558},{"x":0.08013825331207404,"y":0.33792732316759344,"w":0.83562662760416673,"h":0.022627346366819401,"t":"acceptable if the Overall Band Score was 7. However, for a course which has lots of lectures","c":1},{"t":"and spoken instructions, a score of 5 in Listening might be unacceptable even though the","y":0.35747938766760268,"x":0.080246909017188464,"h":0.01752061248527681,"c":1,"w":0.80658437093098956},{"h":0.016048292108362783,"x":0.082304531665047878,"c":1,"w":0.24485595703125002,"y":0.37499999984931076,"t":"Overall Band Score was 7."},{"x":0.1028010133671115,"y":0.39199930522094451,"h":0.019727665347401446,"w":0.79235941569010415,"c":1,"t":"Once you have marked your tests, you should have some idea of whether your listening"},{"t":"and reading skills are good enough for you to try the IELTS test. If you did well enough in","h":0.019482591267328431,"x":0.080192156152503274,"w":0.80258356730143221,"y":0.40971474958704279,"c":1},{"w":0.8314444986979167,"h":0.020169947818535872,"t":"one component, but not in others, you will have to decide for yourself whether you are ready","x":0.080169956758037605,"c":1,"y":0.42754482193404197},{"t":"to take the test.","w":0.14403292338053386,"x":0.078189299486313688,"y":0.4461130744625702,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"y":0.4629920437077798,"x":0.10072055923523739,"t":"The Practice Tests have been checked to ensure that they are of approximately the same","w":0.80678654988606779,"h":0.020616976195426351,"c":1},{"h":0.021036184016610782,"c":1,"w":0.83769007364908854,"t":"level of difficulty as the real IELTS test. However, we cannot guarantee that your score in the","x":0.075999544277566805,"y":0.48065213563527864},{"t":"Practice Tests will be reflected in the real IELTS test. The Practice Tests can only give you","y":0.49720092669158,"h":0.021034652970564505,"c":1,"x":0.080077390885168326,"w":0.81102681477864591},{"t":"an idea of your possible future performance and it is ultimately up to you to make decisions","h":0.019344480355019011,"x":0.078107124566262953,"y":0.51641789267119287,"w":0.82321990966796865,"c":1},{"h":0.019629987305550212,"t":"based on your score.","x":0.077562638461217789,"w":0.19667892456054686,"y":0.53359301738164233,"c":1},{"x":0.10066385617294724,"y":0.55098420860382291,"t":"Different institutions accept different IELTS scores for different types of courses. We have","h":0.022261414005562585,"c":1,"w":0.80485443115234367},{"x":0.078012245016243653,"h":0.022878519918668627,"c":1,"w":0.83371887207031259,"t":"based our recommendations on the average scores which the majority of institutions accept.","y":0.56730492078195749},{"w":0.83570490519205731,"h":0.022413806443500883,"c":1,"y":0.58760373167211999,"t":"The institution to which you are applying may, of course, require a higher or lower score than","x":0.078015957385191737},{"x":0.075936869277643287,"c":1,"w":0.2103858184814453,"t":"most other institutions.","h":0.017793598669297084,"y":0.60442398681771814},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.076131687686256361,"y":0.63662790683359882,"w":0.21810699462890623,"t":"Further information"},{"t":"For more information about IELTS or any other Cambridge English Language Assessment","x":0.075983932847056318,"h":0.022017248668154021,"w":0.81716603597005211,"y":0.6591410266322888,"c":1},{"w":0.20043301900227867,"c":1,"x":0.075729974190325178,"y":0.67604469524204047,"t":"examination, write to:","h":0.021429189944856986},{"y":0.71220930270085236,"x":0.076131682035181572,"t":"Cambridge English Language Assessment","w":0.39300412495930986,"h":0.018944996405827252,"c":1},{"w":0.11733122507731118,"x":0.074050436696626989,"y":0.72957152125719349,"h":0.017601143485384996,"c":1,"t":"1 Hills Road"},{"h":0.018731562071891195,"w":0.10759745279947916,"y":0.74683856568163054,"c":1,"t":"Cambridge","x":0.073892040961865579},{"y":0.76565647192446851,"t":"CB1 2EU","w":0.090765323638916026,"x":0.073958901866471125,"h":0.01665217182801948,"c":1},{"t":"United Kingdom","h":0.019501527712117661,"c":1,"y":0.78275082476279667,"x":0.07363642257879742,"w":0.15104685465494794},{"c":1,"h":0.01889534805351778,"x":0.072016464401026117,"y":0.81976744224579523,"t":"https:\/\/support.cambridgeenglish.org","w":0.3374485524495443},{"c":1,"y":0.83514948870114813,"h":0.021128031053307184,"t":"http:\/\/www.ielts.org","x":0.071714913586344312,"w":0.17965530395507812},{"t":"9","x":0.8971193415982659,"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073251,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.93459302300407465},{"h":0.018365939739034109,"y":0.96576110580585661,"c":1,"w":0.20824770609537757,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39487630679053609}],"w":2400}